    "the first-bag metric is bounded by CATALOGUE COVERAGE, not by the matcher: a null means \"not these catalogued pages\", never \"not this opener\"",
    "the slot-geometry match is a SHAPE test, not an opener test: 87.0% of Triples match the wiki window against 11.8% of Doubles, over 728 verified T-spins",
    "the ordering metric is scored on 73 of 138 rounds — those holding both a T-spin Double and a T-spin Triple; rounds with only one of the two cannot show an order",
